@startuml
skinparam monochrome true

actor "Shipping Agent\nRepresentative" as SAR
participant "Port Management\nSystem" as PMS
actor "Port Authority\nOfficer" as PAO
actor "Logistics\nOperator" as LO

== Vessel Visit Notification Process ==

SAR -> PMS : 1. Submit Vessel Visit Notification\n(with cargo manifest)
activate PMS
PMS --> SAR : Notification submitted (IN_PROGRESS)
deactivate PMS

PAO -> PMS : 2. Review notification
activate PMS
PMS --> PAO : Display notification details
deactivate PMS

PAO -> PMS : 3. Approve & assign dock
activate PMS
PMS --> PAO : Visit approved
PMS --> SAR : Notification: Visit approved
deactivate PMS

LO -> PMS : 4. Plan operations & allocate resources
activate PMS
PMS --> LO : Schedule created
deactivate PMS

LO -> PMS : 5. Execute tasks
activate PMS
PMS --> LO : Task status updates
deactivate PMS


@enduml